---
description: Keep root README app links in alphabetical order.
alwaysApply: true
---

When adding or editing an app in the root `README.md`:

1. Insert the new row in the **Apps** table in alphabetical order by folder slug (the text in the first column and the link label). Use plain ASCII order: hyphens sort before letters, and a shorter slug that is a prefix of a longer one comes first (`hanzi-info` before `hanzi-info-gf14`, `zou-lu-shang` before `zou-lu-shang-2`).
2. Do not append a new link at the end of the table.
3. If the app is an Android APK, add its folder name to the parenthetical APK list in the same alphabetical order.
4. Leave the live-site base URL and the prose around the table as they are. Sort only the catalog entries.
